{% comment %}
  The editable-regions editing style; index.md covers Bookshop. heading takes no
  data-type so it defaults to `span` (plain, no toolbar). body holds HTML, so it
  needs data-type="block" here AND `type: html` in cloudcannon.config.yml — the
  on-canvas region and the sidebar input are independent channels.
{% endcomment %}
<h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="heading" data-rosey="heading">{{ heading }}</h1>
<div data-editable="text" data-type="block" data-prop="body" data-rosey="body">{{ body }}</div>
<p>Sibling with no data-rosey — must stay uneditable.</p>
